#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:10002
#: c18ad30d47b045ce9770be8992e7e179
msgid "FrequencySeries: Basics"
msgstr "FrequencySeries: 基本"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:10004
#: 5688d44ca1ef4ee08b9bc6fa6a770af9
msgid ""
"This notebook introduces the new methods and features of the "
"`FrequencySeries` class extended in `gwexpy`. We will focus on handling "
"complex spectra, calculus operations, filtering (smoothing), and integration"
" with other libraries."
msgstr ""
"このノートブックでは、`gwexpy` で拡張された `FrequencySeries` クラスの新しいメソッドと機能について紹介します。 "
"主に複素スペクトルの扱い、微積分、フィルタリング（スムージング）、および他ライブラリとの連携機能に焦点を当てます。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:30002
#: 3ce5982424124029ad6a7fa6de6a3660
msgid "1. Data Preparation"
msgstr "1. データの準備"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:30004
#: 7c1d403609c04845b16dfe86c213c6a2
msgid ""
"First, we create a `FrequencySeries` from a `TimeSeries` using FFT. Here, we"
" generate a test signal with specific frequency components."
msgstr ""
"まずは `TimeSeries` から FFT を用いて `FrequencySeries` を作成します。 "
"ここでは、特定の周波数成分を持つテスト信号を生成します。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:50002
#: d17fa69864ca4f52b351326c802b4d2c
msgid "2. Visualization and Conversion of Complex Spectra"
msgstr "2. 複素スペクトルの可視化と変換"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:50004
#: c0fad562d40246829efe50165cb1c124
msgid "Phase and Amplitude"
msgstr "位相と振幅"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:50005
#: eaba5b2f3cf04847a0740561119b208b
msgid ""
"Using the `phase()`, `degree()`, and `to_db()` methods, you can convert "
"complex spectra into intuitive units."
msgstr "`phase()`, `degree()`, `to_db()` メソッドを使用すると、複素スペクトルを直感的な単位に変換できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:70002
#: 64e3146ab35f45d1aca2f949b240aeed
msgid "3. Calculus in Frequency Domain"
msgstr "3. 周波数ドメインでの微積分"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:70004
#: 7ecba49dba774881b4390d65c73cfaa5
msgid ""
"The `differentiate()` and `integrate()` methods allow you to perform "
"differentiation and integration in the frequency domain. You can specify the"
" order using the `order` argument (default is 1). This feature makes it easy"
" to convert between displacement, velocity, and acceleration "
"(multiplication/division by $(2 \\pi i f)^n$)."
msgstr ""
"`differentiate()` および `integrate()` メソッドにより、周波数ドメインで微分・積分を行うことができます。 引数 "
"`order` で階数を指定できます（デフォルトは1）。 これは「変位・速度・加速度」の変換（$(2 \\pi i f)^n$ "
"の乗算・除算）を簡単に行うための機能です。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:90002
#: f6663bd9e6bb4e5188be91a51515d512
msgid "4. Spectrum Smoothing and Peak Detection"
msgstr "4. スペクトルのスムージングとピーク検出"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:90004
#: 0979ed306c87462993f9a0d9db872ba7
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "スムージング"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:90005
#: 64b9bae5b04c4e56a46bd5c579fd5135
msgid ""
"The `smooth()` method enables smoothing of the spectrum using moving "
"averages and other techniques."
msgstr "`smooth()` メソッドを使用すると、移動平均などによるスペクトルの平滑化が可能です。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:110002
#: cb448fcca1d44c2a847cdb012af683a3
msgid "Peak Detection"
msgstr "ピーク検出"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:110003
#: cfa222f43e544719beb58ef26ef339e0
msgid ""
"The `find_peaks()` method wraps `scipy.signal.find_peaks`, making it easy to"
" extract peaks above a specific threshold."
msgstr ""
"`find_peaks()` メソッドは `scipy.signal.find_peaks` "
"をラップしており、特定の閾値を超えるピークを簡単に抽出できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:130002
#: 0dd04cae4b884214bac1748772733f50
msgid "5. Advanced Analysis Features"
msgstr "5. 高度な解析機能"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:130004
#: 8c420f8bbbc44e77895f3acf001207b7
msgid "Group Delay"
msgstr "群遅延 (Group Delay)"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:130005
#: 11d78f5909014a7097710e7ecf70b5cf
msgid ""
"The `group_delay()` method calculates the group delay (delay of the signal "
"envelope) from the frequency derivative of the phase."
msgstr "`group_delay()` メソッドは、位相の周波数微分から群遅延（信号のエンベロープの遅延）を計算します。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:150002
#: 523eaa802e724e5285333b47be84e8b1
msgid "Inverse FFT (ifft)"
msgstr "逆FFT (ifft)"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:150003
#: 53de4bcd50414c91a87f8ffa2070c6e6
msgid ""
"The `ifft()` method returns a `TimeSeries`. Even for results from FFT with "
"`mode=\"transient\"`, it can inherit the information and control restoration"
" to the original length (trim=True)."
msgstr ""
"`ifft()` メソッドは、`TimeSeries` を返します。`mode=\"transient\"` で FFT "
"した結果であっても、情報を引き継いで元の長さに戻す (trim=True) などの制御が可能です。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:170002
#: 9ddbecd8aa33414f92e448af2826dfc9
msgid "6. Integration with Other Libraries"
msgstr "6. 他ライブラリとの連携"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:170004
#: 695ac00dd5df413cbc77dd86a8ad9c8b
msgid ""
"Interconversion with Pandas, xarray, and control libraries has been added."
msgstr "Pandas, xarray, control ライブラリとの相互変換が追加されています。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:190002
#: d23a9b0502774edba4d7ac2260d6b309
msgid "7. Integration with Python Control Library"
msgstr "7. Python Control Library との連携"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:190004
#: 5125150b7d90462e8bd7c6d0ba5a5afd
msgid ""
"Interconversion with the **Frequency Response Data (FRD)** object from the "
"`control` library, which is standard in the field of control engineering, is"
" possible. This allows transfer functions measured with GWexpy to be "
"directly used for control system design and analysis."
msgstr ""
"制御工学の分野で標準的な `control` ライブラリの **Frequency Response Data (FRD)** "
"オブジェクトと相互変換が可能です。 これにより、GWexpyで計測した伝達関数を、制御系の設計や解析に直接利用できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:210002
#: 1450628e944248de8d787dfbab4442ae
msgid "8. Quadrature Sum"
msgstr "8. 求積和 (Quadrature Sum)"

#: ../../tutorials/intro_frequencyseries.ipynb:210004
#: 361caac5b50e40c1b5e1cabfe0bcd340
msgid "This feature calculates the sum of orthogonal components."
msgstr "直交位相の和を計算する機能です。"
